The routes, arguments and schemas in wp-json-excerpt.json are cut from the REST index of WordPress 6.9.4
(GET /wp-json/?context=help on a plain install, no plugins), taken on 2026-11-18. wp-json-6.9.4.json is the whole
index of the same version, as syncWpJson wrote it on 2026-11-19 (wordpress-cli's spec/wordpress), formatted by Biome.

